                <span data-lang="pt"
                  >fonte de verdade durável (somente leitura do estado do
                  leilão)</span
                ><span data-lang="en"
                  >durable source of truth (auction state, read-back)</span
                >
              </td>
              <td>
                <span data-lang="pt">não</span><span data-lang="en">no</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <span data-lang="pt">Fraude (shill)</span
